{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfor r in json.load(open('data/controls.json')):\n n=int(r['gcb_id'][-4:])\n if 206<=n<=241 or 309<=n<=314: print('\\\\n',n,r['title'],r['expected'],'\\\\n',r['configuration_method'])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"\n 206 可設定通行碼次數 3以下，但須大於0 \n 開啟終端機，編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nRetry = 3\n\n 207 強制root通行碼須符合通行碼規則 啟用 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，建立客製化profile：\n#authselect create-profile <profile名稱> -b sssd --symlink-meta\n#authselect select custom/<profile名稱> with-sudo with-faillock without-nullok\n開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，更新system-auth與password-auth檔案：\n#!/bin/bash\nCP=$(authselect current | awk 'NR == 1 {print $3}' | grep custom/)\nfor FN in system-auth password-auth; do\n    [[ -n $CP ]] && PTF=/etc/authselect/$CP/$FN || PTF=/etc/authselect/$FN\n    [[ -z $(grep -E '^\\s*password\\s+requisite\\s+pam_pwquality.so\\s+.*enforce_for_root\\s*.*$' $PTF) ]] && sed -ri 's/^\\s*(password\\s+requisite\\s+pam_pwquality.so\\s+)(.*)$/\\1\\2 enforce_for_root/' $PTF\ndone\nauthselect apply-changes\n\n 208 通行碼最小長度 12個字元以上 \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nPASS_MIN_LEN 12\n編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nminlen = 12\n\n 209 通行碼必須至少包含字元類別數量 4 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nminclass = 4\n\n 210 通行碼必須至少包含數字個數 1個以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\ndcredit = -1\n\n 211 通行碼必須至少包含大寫字母個數 1個以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nucredit = -1\n\n 212 通行碼必須至少包含小寫字母個數 1個以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nlcredit = -1\n\n 213 通行碼必須至少包含特殊字元個數 1個以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nocredit = -1\n\n 214 新通行碼與舊通行碼最少相異字元數 3以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\ndifok = 3\n\n 215 同一類別字元可連續使用個數 4以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nmaxclassrepeat = 4\n\n 216 相同字元可連續使用個數 3以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nmaxrepeat = 3\n\n 217 必須禁止使用字典檔單字做為通行碼 1 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\ndictcheck=1\n\n 218 帳戶鎖定閾值 5次以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/security/faillock.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\ndeny = 5\n\n 219 帳戶鎖定時間 900秒以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/faillock.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nunlock_time = 900\n\n 220 強制執行通行碼歷程記錄 3以上 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，建立客製化profile：\n#authselect create-profile <profile名稱> -b sssd --symlink-meta\n#authselect select custom/<profile名稱> with-sudo with-faillock without-nullok\n開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，新增或修改設定為「remember=3」，更新system-auth檔案：\n#!/bin/bash\nCP=$(authselect current | awk 'NR == 1 {print $3}' | grep custom/)\n    [[ -n $CP ]] && PTF=/etc/authselect/$CP/system-auth || PTF=/etc/authselect/system-auth\n    [[ -n $(grep -E '^\\s*password\\s+(sufficient\\s+pam_unix|requi(red|site)\\s+pam_pwhistory).so\\s+([^#]+\\s+)*remember=\\S+\\s*.*$' $PTF) ]] && sed -ri 's/^\\s*(password\\s+(requisite|sufficient)\\s+(pam_pwquality\\.so|pam_unix\\.so)\\s+)(.*)(remember=\\S+\\s*)(.*)$/\\1\\4 remember=3 \\6/' $PTF || sed -ri 's/^\\s*(password\\s+(requisite|sufficient)\\s+(pam_pwquality\\.so|pam_unix\\.so)\\s+)(.*)$/\\1\\4 remember=3/' $PTF\nauthselect apply-changes\n\n 221 顯示登入失敗次數與日期 啟用 \n 編輯/etc/pam.d/postlogin檔案，新增或修改以下內容至檔案最上方：\nsession required pam_lastlog.so showfailed\n\n 222 通行碼雜湊演算法 SHA512 \n 編輯/etc/libuser.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\ncrypt_style = sha512\n編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nENCRYPT_METHOD SHA512\n開啟終端機，執行以下指令，建立客製化profile：\n#authselect create-profile <profile名稱> -b sssd --symlink-meta\n#authselect select custom/<profile名稱> with-sudo with-faillock without-nullok\n開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，新增或修改設定為「sha512」，更新system-auth與password-auth檔案：\n#!/bin/bash\nCP=$(authselect current | awk 'NR == 1 {print $3}' | grep custom/)\nfor FN in system-auth password-auth; do\n[[ -n $CP ]] && PTF=/etc/authselect/$CP/$FN || PTF=/etc/authselect/$FN\n[[ -z $(grep -E '^\\s*password\\s+sufficient\\s+pam_unix.so\\s+.*sha512\\s*.*$' $PTF) ]] && sed -ri 's/^\\s*(password\\s+sufficient\\s+pam_unix.so\\s+)(.*)$/\\1\\2 sha512/' $PTF\ndone\nauthselect apply-changes\n\n 223 通行碼最短使用期限 1天以上 \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，設定PASS_MIN_DAYS參數如下：\nPASS_MIN_DAYS 1\n針對進行上述設定前已存在之使用者帳號，須再執行下列指令，使該帳號之通行碼最短使用期限變更為1天：\n#chage --mindays 1 (使用者帳號名稱)\n\n 224 通行碼到期前提醒使用者變更通行碼 14天以上 \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，設定PASS_WARN_AGE參數如下：\nPASS_WARN_AGE 14\n針對進行上述設定前已存在之使用者帳號，須再執行下列指令，才能使通行碼到期前14天提醒使用者變更通行碼：\n#chage --warndays 14 (使用者帳號名稱)\n\n 225 通行碼最長使用期限 90天以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，設定PASS_MAX_DAYS參數如下：\nPASS_MAX_DAYS 90\n針對進行上述設定前已存在之使用者帳號，須再執行下列指令，才能使通行碼最長使用期限變更為90天：\n#chage --maxdays 90 (使用者帳號名稱)\n\n 226 通行碼到期後，帳號停用前之天數 30天以下，但須大於0 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，設定通行碼到期後之帳號停用天數：\n#useradd -D -f 30\n針對進行上述設定前已存在之使用者帳號，須再執行下列指令，才能使通行碼到期後，超過30天即停用帳號：\n#chage --inactive 30 (使用者帳號名稱)\n\n 227 登入嘗試失敗之延遲時間 4秒以上 \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，將FAIL_DELAY參數值設為4以上，範例如下：\nFAIL_DELAY 4\n\n 228 新使用者帳號預設建立使用者家目錄 yes \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，設定CREATE_HOME參數如下：\nCREATE_HOME yes\n\n 229 要求使用者必須經過身分鑑別才能提升權限 要求身分鑑別 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，尋找「NOPASSWD」或「!authenticate」：\n#egrep -i '(nopasswd|!authenticate)' /etc/sudoers /etc/sudoers.d/*\n執行「visudo -f」指令編輯/etc/sudoers檔案或 /etc/sudoers.d/目錄下檔案，針對包含「NOPASSWD」或「!authenticate」之指令行，予以註解(#)或刪除\n\n 230 限制每個帳號可同時登入之數量 10以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/security/limits.conf檔案或/etc/security/limits.d/目錄下之「.conf」檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\n* hard maxlogins 10\n\n 231 kbd套件 安裝 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，安裝kbd套件：\n#dnf install kbd.x86_64\n\n 232 使用者會談鎖定 啟用 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，建立或編輯資料庫，設定螢幕保護裝置：\n#vim /etc/dconf/db/local.d/00-screensaver\n編輯資料庫之「org/gnome/desktop/screensaver」段落，新增或修改成以下內容：\n[org/gnome/desktop/screensaver]\n##Set this to true to lock the screen when the screensaver activates\nlock-enabled=true\n執行以下指令更新系統資料庫：\n#dconf update\n\n 233 GNOME使用者會談逾時時間 900秒以下，但須大於0 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，建立或編輯資料庫，設定螢幕保護裝置：\n#vim /etc/dconf/db/local.d/00-screensaver\n編輯資料庫之「org/gnome/desktop/session」段落，新增或修改成以下內容：\n[org/gnome/desktop/session]\n##Set the lock time out to 900 seconds before the session is considered idle\nidle-delay=uint32 900\n執行以下指令更新系統資料庫：\n#dconf update\n\n 234 禁止GNOME使用者自動登入 false \n 編輯/etc/gdm/custom.conf檔案，在「daemon]」段落，新增或修改成以下內容：\n[daemon]\nAutomaticLoginEnable=false\n\n 235 系統帳號登入方式 nologin \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，設定系統帳號(sync、shutdown及halt帳號除外)不可使用殼層(Shell)登入：\n#awk -F: '($1!=\"root\" && $1!=\"sync\" && $1!=\"shutdown\" && $1!=\"halt\" && $1!~/^\\+/ && $3<'\"$(awk '/^\\s*UID_MIN/{print $2}' /etc/login.defs)\"' && $7!=\"'\"$(which nologin)\"'\" && $7!=\"/bin/false\") {print $1}' /etc/passwd | while read user; do usermod -s $(which nologin) $user; done\n執行以下指令，鎖定所有非root之系統帳號：\n#awk -F: '($1!=\"root\" && $1!~/^\\+/ && $3<'\"$(awk '/^\\s*UID_MIN/{print $2}' /etc/login.defs)\"') {print $1}' /etc/passwd | xargs -I '{}' passwd -S '{}' | awk '($2!=\"L\" && $2!=\"LK\") {print $1}' | while read user; do usermod -L $user; done\n\n 236 Bash shell閒置時登出時間 900秒以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/bashrc檔案，新增或修改參數如下：\nreadonly TMOUT=900 ; export TMOUT\n編輯/etc/profile檔案或/etc/profile.d/目錄下之「.sh」檔案，新增或修改參數如下：\nreadonly TMOUT=900 ; export TMOUT\n\n 237 防止修改圖形使用者介面(GUI)設定 啟用 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，建立或編輯資料庫，設定防止修改圖形使用者介面(GUI)設定：\n#vim /etc/dconf/db/local.d/locks/session\n編輯資料庫，新增或修改成以下內容：\n/org/gnome/desktop/session/idle-delay\n/org/gnome/desktop/screensaver/lock-enabled\n/org/gnome/desktop/screensaver/lock-delay\n/org/gnome/desktop/lockdown/disable-lock-screen\n\n 238 root帳號所屬群組 GID 0 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，設定root帳號所屬群組：\n#usermod -g 0 root\n\n 239 所有使用者帳號之預設umask 027或更低權限 \n 編輯/etc/profile檔案、/etc/profile.d/目錄下之「.sh」檔案及/etc/bashrc檔案，新增或修改參數如下：\numask 027\n\n 240 在/etc/login.defs設定所有使用者之預設umask 027或更低權限 \n 編輯/etc/login.defs檔案，設定UMASK參數值如下：\nUMASK 027\n\n 241 可使用su指令之群組 僅限wheel群組才能使用su指令 \n 編輯/etc/pam.d/su檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nauth required pam_wheel.so use_uid\n編輯/etc/group檔案之wheel群組設定，建立允許使用su指令之使用者帳號清單，如下所示：\nwheel:x:GID:root,(使用者帳號清單)\n範例：如欲在wheel群組(GID為10)建立允許root、user1及user2帳號使用su指令，內容如下：\nwheel:x:10:root,user1,user2\n\n 309 root之預設umask 027或更低權限 \n 編輯/root/.bash_profile檔案/root/.bashrc，新增或修改參數如下：\numask 027\n\n 310 root帳戶鎖定時間 60秒以上 \n 編輯/etc/security/faillock.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\neven_deny_root\nroot_unlock_time=60\n\n 311 連續字元序列可使用個數 3以下，但須大於0 \n 編輯/etc/security/pwquality.conf檔案，新增或修改成以下內容：\nmaxsequence=3\n\n 312 啟用without-nullok 啟用 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，啟用without-nullok：\n#authselect enable-feature without-nullok\n\n 313 啟用pam_pwquality 啟用 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，檢查是否有pam_pwquality.so：\ngrep -P -- '\\bpam_pwquality\\.so\\b' /etc/pam.d/{password,system}-auth\n若顯示空白，開啟終端機，編輯/etc/pam.d/password-auth與/etc/pam.d/system-auth，新增以下內容：\npassword requisite pam_pwquality.so local_users_only\n\n 314 啟用pam_unix 啟用 \n 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，檢查是否有pam_unix.so：\ngrep -P -- '\\bpam_unix\\.so\\b' /etc/pam.d/{password,system}-auth\n若顯示空白，開啟終端機，編輯/etc/pam.d/password-auth與/etc/pam.d/system-auth，新增以下內容：\nauth sufficient pam_unix.so\naccount required pam_unix.so\npassword sufficient pam_unix.so sha512 shadow use_authtok\nsession required pam_unix.so\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"來源逐條擷取已確認，部分條目與任務中的家族提示不同：0227 是 login.defs 的 FAIL_DELAY、0228 是 login.defs 的 CREATE_HOME、0235 使用 UID_MIN 並另要求鎖定系統帳號。我會依來源方法實作，將既有帳號、authselect 與 dconf 的驗證限制列入待批清單；缺檔不會判為 PASS。另已讀取 cloud runtime skill；本環境未提供其狀態工具，本次也不需網路操作。\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > linuxgcb/p2b6_runtime.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Read-only source predicates; embedded directly in python3 argv.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport glob\nimport os\nimport re\nimport subprocess\nROOT = ''\n\n\ndef read(path):\n    with open(ROOT + path, encoding='utf-8') as stream:\n        return stream.read()\n\n\ndef lines(path):\n    return [s.split('#', 1)[0].strip() for s in read(path).splitlines()\n            if s.split('#', 1)[0].strip()]\n\n\ndef paths(pattern):\n    return sorted(p[len(ROOT):] for p in glob.glob(ROOT + pattern))\n\n\ndef value(path, key, equal=True, section=None):\n    found = None\n    current = None\n    for line in lines(path):\n        if line.startswith('['):\n            current = line\n        elif section is None or current == '[' + section + ']':\n            m = re.fullmatch(re.escape(key) + (r'\\\\s*=\\\\s*(.*?)' if equal else r'\\\\s+(.*?)'), line)\n            if m:\n                found = m[1].strip()\n    return found\n\n\ndef number(path, key, low=None, high=None, equal=True, section=None):\n    v = value(path, key, equal, section)\n    return (v is not None and re.fullmatch(r'-?\\\\d+', v) is not None\n            and (low is None or int(v) >= low) and (high is None or int(v) <= high))\n\n\ndef pam(path, kind, control, module, options=()):\n    matches = []\n    for line in lines(path):\n        tokens = line.split()\n        if len(tokens) >= 3 and tokens[0] == kind and tokens[1] in control and tokens[2] == module:\n            matches.append(tokens[3:])\n    return bool(matches) and all(all(option in opts for option in options) for opts in matches)\n\n\ndef stacks(kind, control, module, options=()):\n    return all(pam('/etc/pam.d/' + name, kind, control, module, options)\n               for name in ('system-auth', 'password-auth'))\n\n\ndef history():\n    candidates = [s.split() for s in lines('/etc/pam.d/system-auth')]\n    options = [t[3:] for t in candidates if len(t) >= 3 and t[0] == 'password'\n               and t[1] in ('required', 'requisite') and t[2] == 'pam_pwhistory.so']\n    return bool(options) and all(any(re.fullmatch(r'remember=\\\\d+', x) and int(x.split('=')[1]) >= 3 for x in opts) for opts in options)\n\n\ndef sudo():\n    names = ['/etc/sudoers'] + paths('/etc/sudoers.d/*')\n    for path in names:\n        for raw in read(path).splitlines():\n            if re.match(r'\\\\s*(?:#|@)include', raw) and not re.fullmatch(r'\\\\s*(?:#|@)includedir\\\\s+/etc/sudoers.d\\\\s*', raw):\n                return False\n        if any(re.search(r'\\\\bNOPASSWD\\\\b|\"'!authenticate'\"\\\\b', s, re.I) for s in lines(path)):\n            return False\n    return True\n\n\ndef maxlogins():\n    entries = [s.split() for p in ['/etc/security/limits.conf'] + paths('/etc/security/limits.d/*.conf') for s in lines(p)]\n    settings = [t for t in entries if len(t) == 4 and t[2] == 'maxlogins']\n    return (any(t[:3] == ['*', 'hard', 'maxlogins'] for t in settings)\n            and all(t[3].isdigit() and 0 < int(t[3]) <= 10 for t in settings))\n\n\ndef accounts():\n    threshold = value('/etc/login.defs', 'UID_MIN', False)\n    if threshold is None or not threshold.isdigit():\n        return False\n    users = [s.split(':') for s in lines('/etc/passwd')]\n    for t in users:\n        if len(t) \"'!= 7 or not t[2].isdigit():\n            return False\n        if t[0] != '\"'root' and not t[0].startswith('+') and int(t[2]) < int(threshold):\n            if t[0] not in ('sync', 'shutdown', 'halt') and t[6] not in ('/sbin/nologin', '/usr/sbin/nologin', '/bin/false'):\n                return False\n            result = subprocess.run(['/usr/bin/passwd', '-S', t[0]], capture_output=True, text=True)\n            if result.returncode or len(result.stdout.split()) < 2 or result.stdout.split()[1] not in ('L', 'LK'):\n                return False\n    return bool(users)\n\n\ndef shell_setting(names, key):\n    values = []\n    for path in names:\n        for line in lines(path):\n            if key == 'umask':\n                m = re.fullmatch(r'umask\\\\s+([0-7]{3,4})\\\\s*;?', line)\n                if m:\n                    values.append(int(m[1], 8) & 0o027 == 0o027)\n            else:\n                m = re.fullmatch(r'(?:readonly\\\\s+)?TMOUT\\\\s*=\\\\s*(\\\\d+)\\\\s*(?:;\\\\s*export\\\\s+TMOUT\\\\s*)?', line)\n                if m:\n                    values.append(0 < int(m[1]) <= 900)\n    return bool(values) and all(values)\n\n\ndef check(n):\n    pw = '/etc/security/pwquality.conf'\n    login = '/etc/login.defs'\n    numeric = {206:(pw,'retry',1,3,True),208:(pw,'minlen',12,None,True),209:(pw,'minclass',4,4,True),\n        210:(pw,'dcredit',None,-1,True),211:(pw,'ucredit',None,-1,True),212:(pw,'lcredit',None,-1,True),213:(pw,'ocredit',None,-1,True),\n        214:(pw,'difok',3,None,True),215:(pw,'maxclassrepeat',1,4,True),216:(pw,'maxrepeat',1,3,True),217:(pw,'dictcheck',1,1,True),\n        218:('/etc/security/faillock.conf','deny',1,5,True),219:('/etc/security/faillock.conf','unlock_time',900,None,True),\n        223:(login,'PASS_MIN_DAYS',1,None,False),224:(login,'PASS_WARN_AGE',14,None,False),225:(login,'PASS_MAX_DAYS',1,90,False),\n        226:('/etc/default/useradd','INACTIVE',1,30,True),227:(login,'FAIL_DELAY',4,None,False),311:(pw,'maxsequence',1,3,True)}\n    if n in numeric:\n        ok = number(*numeric[n])\n        return ok and (n \"'!= 208 or number(login,'\"'PASS_MIN_LEN',12,None,False))\n    if n == 207: return stacks('password',('requisite',),'pam_pwquality.so',('enforce_for_root',))\n    if n == 220: return history()\n    if n == 221: return lines('/etc/pam.d/postlogin')[0] == 'session required pam_lastlog.so showfailed'\n    if n == 222: return value('/etc/libuser.conf','crypt_style') == 'sha512' and value(login,'ENCRYPT_METHOD',False) == 'SHA512' and stacks('password',('sufficient',),'pam_unix.so',('sha512',))\n    if n == 228: return value(login,'CREATE_HOME',False) == 'yes'\n    if n == 229: return sudo()\n    if n == 230: return maxlogins()\n    if n == 231:\n        result = subprocess.run(['/usr/bin/rpm','-q','kbd'], capture_output=True, text=True)\n        if result.returncode not in (0,1): raise ValueError('rpm query error')\n        return result.returncode == 0 and bool(result.stdout.strip())\n    if n == 232: return value('/etc/dconf/db/local.d/00-screensaver','lock-enabled',section='org/gnome/desktop/screensaver') == 'true'\n    if n == 233:\n        v = value('/etc/dconf/db/local.d/00-screensaver','idle-delay',section='org/gnome/desktop/session')\n        return v is not None and re.fullmatch(r'uint32\\\\s+\\\\d+',v) is not None and 0 < int(v.split()[1]) <= 900\n    if n == 234: return value('/etc/gdm/custom.conf','AutomaticLoginEnable',section='daemon') == 'false'\n    if n == 235: return accounts()\n    if n == 236: return shell_setting(['/etc/bashrc'],'TMOUT') and shell_setting(['/etc/profile'] + paths('/etc/profile.d/*.sh'),'TMOUT')\n    if n == 237: return all('/org/gnome/desktop/' + s in lines('/etc/dconf/db/local.d/locks/session') for s in ('session/idle-delay','screensaver/lock-enabled','screensaver/lock-delay','lockdown/disable-lock-screen'))\n    if n == 238:\n        roots = [s.split(':') for s in lines('/etc/passwd') if s.split(':')[0] == 'root']\n        return len(roots) == 1 and len(roots[0]) == 7 and roots[0][3] == '0'\n    if n == 239: return shell_setting(['/etc/bashrc'],'umask') and shell_setting(['/etc/profile'] + paths('/etc/profile.d/*.sh'),'umask')\n    if n == 240:\n        v = value(login,'UMASK',False)\n        return v is not None and re.fullmatch(r'[0-7]{3,4}',v) is not None and int(v,8) & 0o027 == 0o027\n    if n == 241: return pam('/etc/pam.d/su','auth',('required',),'pam_wheel.so',('use_uid',)) and any(len(t)==4 and t[0]=='wheel' and 'root' in t[3].split(',') for t in (s.split(':') for s in lines('/etc/group')))\n    if n == 309: return shell_setting(['/root/.bashrc'],'umask') and shell_setting(['/root/.bash_profile'],'umask')\n    if n == 310: return 'even_deny_root' in lines('/etc/security/faillock.conf') and number('/etc/security/faillock.conf','root_unlock_time',60)\n    if n == 312: return stacks('auth',('sufficient',),'pam_unix.so') and all('nullok' not in s.split()[3:] for name in ('system-auth','password-auth') for s in lines('/etc/pam.d/'+name) if 'pam_unix.so' in s.split())\n    if n == 313: return stacks('password',('requisite',),'pam_pwquality.so',('local_users_only',))\n    if n == 314: return all(stacks(kind,(control,),'pam_unix.so',opts) for kind,control,opts in (('auth','sufficient',()),('account','required',()),('password','sufficient',('sha512','shadow','use_authtok')),('session','required',())))\n    raise ValueError(n)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > linuxgcb/p2b6_runtime.py <<'PY'\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Read-only source predicates; embedded directly in python3 argv.\\\"\\\"\\\"\nimport glob\nimport os\nimport re\nimport subprocess\nROOT = ''\n\n\ndef read(path):\n    with open(ROOT + path, encoding='utf-8') as stream:\n        return stream.read()\n\n\ndef lines(path):\n    return [s.split('#', 1)[0].strip() for s in read(path).splitlines()\n            if s.split('#', 1)[0].strip()]\n\n\ndef paths(pattern):\n    return sorted(p[len(ROOT):] for p in glob.glob(ROOT + pattern))\n\n\ndef value(path, key, equal=True, section=None):\n    found = None\n    current = None\n    for line in lines(path):\n        if line.startswith('['):\n            current = line\n        elif section is None or current == '[' + section + ']':\n            m = re.fullmatch(re.escape(key) + (r'\\\\s*=\\\\s*(.*?)' if equal else r'\\\\s+(.*?)'), line)\n            if m:\n                found = m[1].strip()\n    return found\n\n\ndef number(path, key, low=None, high=None, equal=True, section=None):\n    v = value(path, key, equal, section)\n    return (v is not None and re.fullmatch(r'-?\\\\d+', v) is not None\n            and (low is None or int(v) >= low) and (high is None or int(v) <= high))\n\n\ndef pam(path, kind, control, module, options=()):\n    matches = []\n    for line in lines(path):\n        tokens = line.split()\n        if len(tokens) >= 3 and tokens[0] == kind and tokens[1] in control and tokens[2] == module:\n            matches.append(tokens[3:])\n    return bool(matches) and all(all(option in opts for option in options) for opts in matches)\n\n\ndef stacks(kind, control, module, options=()):\n    return all(pam('/etc/pam.d/' + name, kind, control, module, options)\n               for name in ('system-auth', 'password-auth'))\n\n\ndef history():\n    candidates = [s.split() for s in lines('/etc/pam.d/system-auth')]\n    opti